-	  Enable support for the one-lane PCIe Gen3 PHY of the Google zuma
-	  (Tensor G3) SoC. It is used by the gs201 PCIe controller driver,
-	  which connects the Wi-Fi chip on Pixel 8 phones. The PHY is
-	  programmed from stock's register tables, and its power-down
-	  isolation is released through the PMU.
+	  Enable support for the PCIe Gen3 PHYs of the Google zuma (Tensor G3)
